      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "NOBLE TOBY (1) finished second (22.01) two back at this track but out of the placings last time when 6th there. Solid record here at the distance winning three races. The form from his last run is stacking up nicely. Should bounce back. GO GO CAMBLA (2) put in a much better performance last start when in the placings at this track behind Art Of Deception (22.04) in a Mix 5. Led around the bend before fighting on well and should give a sight. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings six times from 11 starts. Leading player again. HEY ERNIE (3) led all the way last time out to score by half a length (19.03) at Q Straight in a OPEN over 350m. Winner at his latest appearance in one of the quickest times on the card. Deserves serious consideration again. SISSY MAYBELLE (7) is another with top-three prospects.",
